        "Text": [
          "Reanimated Dead are Undead enemies with 2 Threat, 2 Attack, 2 Defense and 2 hit points.\nProgress that would be placed on this quest is instead placed on locations in the staging area, divided as you choose.\nForced: At the end of the quest phase, if there are any locations in play, deal 1 damage to all characters in play. If there are no locations in play, the players have escaped Carn D\u00FBm, and win the game.\n"
        ],
